WEBVTT

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.448
THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.394
EPISODE 79

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:44.604
SWING

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:46.439
What are you doing?

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:50.902
We're going to golf
with some clients at work.

00:01:50.985 --> 00:01:52.403
I've never played before.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:53.321
PLUCK

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:56.074
Don't worry, Miku.

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:58.660
I happen to be good at golf.
I'll teach you.

00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:00.203
Seriously? That's unexpected.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:03.289
I used to go loads with my old boss.

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:04.249
Nice shot!

00:02:04.332 --> 00:02:05.291
-Nice shot!
-Nice shot!

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:08.670
KATAGI COUNTRY CLUB

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.631
Whoa, it's so spacious!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.342
I'm kinda intimidated.

00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:16.678
Playing golf brings back memories.

00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:19.639
You sure I should start out
at a place like this?

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:22.141
The best training is to actually play.

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:25.353
-Tacchan, you really used to play golf?
-Yeah.

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:29.065
-Yakuza and golf go hand-in-hand.
-News to me.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.277
The first weapon of choice is the driver.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.029
Space your feet a dagger's length apart.

00:02:35.113 --> 00:02:37.031
Left foot behind the ammo.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.950
Keep your eyes locked.

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:42.412
Give it a good stare down.
Don't let it mess with you or it's over!

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:45.331
Keep your head absolutely still,
even if you get hit.

00:02:45.415 --> 00:02:46.875
Your explanation makes no sense.

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:49.294
Then rotate your hips,

00:02:49.377 --> 00:02:51.296
relax, and whack!

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:52.255
WHACK

00:02:53.047 --> 00:02:53.882
THUD

00:02:53.965 --> 00:02:54.924
Whoa!

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:57.760
The ball seemed like it flew,
but it barely went anywhere.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.762
Exactly. You noticed.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:03.516
Make sure you never hit it
farther than the boss.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:05.268
-Ever!
-I see.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:09.105
I remember an underling
who once hit a longer drive than our boss.

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.107
Got his head totally smashed in.

00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:14.569
Still, don't make it obvious
you're holding back.

00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:17.488
Whack the ball
with just the right amount of force!

00:03:17.572 --> 00:03:18.823
I'll just let him go on.

00:03:18.907 --> 00:03:21.701
Okay, feet comfortably apart…

00:03:21.784 --> 00:03:22.660
CLACK

00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:24.370
Nice shot!

00:03:24.954 --> 00:03:28.374
When a higher-up hits,
just yell, "Nice shot!"

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:29.834
Use your diaphragm.

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:31.878
What's any of that got to do with golf?

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:37.091
Approximately 50 yards.
A two-meter easterly wind…

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:39.010
Add spin.

00:03:39.093 --> 00:03:41.095
Make 'em think the shot'll
get on the green.

00:03:41.179 --> 00:03:42.222
SPLOSH

00:03:42.305 --> 00:03:43.932
A Pond-Splosh. Perfect!

00:03:44.015 --> 00:03:45.099
An unnecessary technique.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.228
THWACK, THUD

00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:50.021
Nice shot!

00:03:52.982 --> 00:03:54.108
What's this about?

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:55.944
Act like you're analyzing the grass.

00:03:57.236 --> 00:04:00.031
"Putt for dough," as the adage goes.

00:04:00.114 --> 00:04:03.076
The boss loves any saying
that has to do with money.

00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:06.246
Sink the putt before the boss

00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:09.040
-and you'll be sinking in the ocean--
-Whatever.

00:04:09.874 --> 00:04:10.750
Like this?

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:14.671
-Oh, so close!
-That was a close call.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:15.672
SWOOP

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:26.140
EPISODE 80

00:04:33.147 --> 00:04:36.567
This is the boss's turf. Watch yourself.

00:04:36.651 --> 00:04:37.485
Yes, sir!

00:04:37.568 --> 00:04:39.946
Don't forget the big guy's cut.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.657
You haven't lost your edge, have you?

00:04:43.241 --> 00:04:45.368
I was taught well long ago.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.579
Come on, we're hunting bamboo shoots!

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:52.500
There it is! It's a bamboo shoot!

00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:55.461
You got some nerve showing your face!
Don't mess with us!

00:04:56.045 --> 00:04:57.171
You dumbass!

00:04:57.255 --> 00:04:58.923
That one's way too big.

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:01.676
It'll be too bitter to eat!

00:05:01.759 --> 00:05:02.593
Sorry.

00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:06.014
It should be peeking out just a little
like this when you step by it.

00:05:06.097 --> 00:05:07.640
DIG DIG

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:10.643
This one's just ripe for picking!

00:05:11.227 --> 00:05:12.312
Got one!

00:05:12.395 --> 00:05:15.273
You see?!
That's the Immortal Dragon for you!

00:05:15.857 --> 00:05:17.984
Aim for the ones with the green tips!

00:05:18.568 --> 00:05:19.444
Over here!

00:05:20.028 --> 00:05:21.321
Bring the tools!

00:05:21.404 --> 00:05:22.822
You're not getting away!

00:05:25.241 --> 00:05:28.161
We've got quite a haul already…

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:33.082
Hey, now. Whose turf
do you think you're stealing from?

00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:34.792
Answer me!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.551
Bring it on! I'll call in the lads.
Just you wait!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.346
Wait!

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.515
Oh, no! Don't!

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:51.392
What's he doing slacking?

00:05:52.894 --> 00:05:55.521
So we were able to take back…

00:05:56.355 --> 00:05:57.315
just one.

00:05:57.398 --> 00:05:58.232
It's puny!

00:05:58.316 --> 00:06:03.488
We got raided on the boss's own turf
and now all we got is this single shoot.

00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:06.199
The boss ain't gonna let this slide.

00:06:06.783 --> 00:06:08.659
How are you gonna make up
for this, huh?!

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:12.455
Hold it. I've got an idea.

00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:18.628
And? How's the haul?

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:19.545
Tatsu…

00:06:21.005 --> 00:06:23.966
I already cooked it for you, Boss!
Please, have a taste!

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:28.971
Mixed rice, clear soup,
and a savory custard!

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:30.681
Must have been quite a load.

00:06:30.765 --> 00:06:32.642
Well, uh… Yes.

00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:36.020
THUD THUD

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:40.274
The bamboo sure is sliced thin.

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:42.777
That's… just how it is.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:43.778
SNIFF

00:06:43.861 --> 00:06:45.988
The Way of the Househusband!

00:06:47.865 --> 00:06:48.699
EPISODE 81

00:06:48.783 --> 00:06:49.742
CHEN'S CHINESE

00:06:49.826 --> 00:06:53.204
-Hello there, Chen.
-Nice to see you again, Mr. Tatsu!

00:06:53.287 --> 00:06:56.916
This aroma…
You imported a new haul, Chen?

00:06:56.999 --> 00:07:00.878
Yes, unbelievable stuff.
Rare and authentic.

00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:02.505
It's kinda hot in here.

00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:03.840
What is that smell?

00:07:03.923 --> 00:07:05.591
You've caught on.

00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:08.219
This place is no ordinary
local Chinese joint.

00:07:08.302 --> 00:07:10.054
There's a varied secret menu!

00:07:10.138 --> 00:07:11.556
That's right!

00:07:11.639 --> 00:07:15.143
An exquisite blend of ingredients
devised by yours truly. Try it!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.437
It's my brand-new,
ultra-spicy Sichuan hot pot!

00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.730
Whoa, looks spicy!

00:07:19.814 --> 00:07:22.275
The real deal is exponentially spicier
than in Japan.

00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:24.694
If you can finish it, it's free of charge.

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:28.281
That confidence must mean
you've used pretty potent powder.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.242
Free of charge? Lucky us!

00:07:31.325 --> 00:07:32.201
Piece of cake!

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:34.662
Your time limit is 30 minutes.

00:07:34.745 --> 00:07:35.997
Go!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.709
This is beyond spicy!

00:07:40.543 --> 00:07:41.461
I'm going to die.

00:07:41.544 --> 00:07:44.422
We're being raided by chilies
and Sichuan pepper!

00:07:44.505 --> 00:07:48.134
But the umami is definitely there,
hidden in a complex spiciness.

00:07:48.217 --> 00:07:49.844
It makes you want more!

00:07:49.927 --> 00:07:51.053
I can't stop!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.348
Need water…

00:07:54.432 --> 00:07:57.435
Masa! If you go down that road,
you can never come back!

00:07:58.311 --> 00:08:00.313
Spice doesn't easily mix with water.

00:08:00.396 --> 00:08:02.648
It'll only spread it around your mouth…

00:08:03.232 --> 00:08:04.066
more.

00:08:04.692 --> 00:08:05.568
GULP

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:09.780
Oh, this is no good.

00:08:10.573 --> 00:08:12.033
Miku!

00:08:12.116 --> 00:08:13.743
1:10:05 P.M. - MIKU DISQUALIFIED

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:16.412
How dare you do that to her!

00:08:16.495 --> 00:08:18.456
I'm gonna down it!

00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:22.418
1:10:20 P.M. - MASA DISQUALIFIED

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:25.379
So, that's how you wanna play?

00:08:26.214 --> 00:08:28.090
It's payback time!

00:08:31.135 --> 00:08:33.095
That's a lot of blowing.

00:08:33.638 --> 00:08:37.266
Chen, get me a big bowl o' rice, will you?

00:08:37.892 --> 00:08:38.726
Are you serious?

00:08:38.809 --> 00:08:39.644
THUD

00:08:39.727 --> 00:08:41.437
I'm not responsible for what happens!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.397
SCARF SCARF

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:47.318
I see! You're neutralizing the spice
with the rice!

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:51.405
I'm full.

00:08:51.489 --> 00:08:53.241
1:20:03 P.M. - TATSU DISQUALIFIED

00:08:54.533 --> 00:08:55.993
Don't scare me like that.

00:08:56.077 --> 00:08:56.953
CLATTER

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.164
It was absolutely delicious.
Thank you very much.

00:09:01.249 --> 00:09:03.626
You finished the whole pot?!

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:07.088
The extremely well-considered blend
of spice and pepper

00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:10.591
balanced impeccably
with the other seasonings.

00:09:10.675 --> 00:09:12.927
The special double-flavor hot pot

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:17.223
added variety to the spice mix,
ensuring I never tired of it.

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:20.851
Just enjoying the dish
would be enough to fully satisfy me,

00:09:20.935 --> 00:09:23.479
so I feel somewhat sheepish
for doing so free of charge--

00:09:23.562 --> 00:09:24.981
You sure do talk a lot!

00:09:25.815 --> 00:09:27.275
The Way of the Househusband.

00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:28.484
COUGH

00:09:30.069 --> 00:09:31.028
EPISODE 82

00:09:31.112 --> 00:09:31.946
DING DONG

00:09:33.322 --> 00:09:35.408
What is it?

00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:37.118
Shut up! Who the hell--

00:09:37.201 --> 00:09:40.329
It's a surprise housekeeping inspection!

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:42.498
Hey, Boss. You startled me.

00:09:42.581 --> 00:09:45.835
I was passing by and I wanted to check--

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.545
-It stinks!
-Huh? What?

00:09:47.628 --> 00:09:50.881
Well, I guess moisture
does build up at the entrance.

00:09:50.965 --> 00:09:52.633
Come in, I'll make us some tea.

00:09:52.717 --> 00:09:55.428
You keep the place pretty tidy--
It stinks!

00:09:55.511 --> 00:09:56.345
Oh, really?

00:09:56.429 --> 00:09:58.264
Alrighty-- It stinks!

00:09:58.347 --> 00:10:00.057
You're exaggerating, Boss!

00:10:00.141 --> 00:10:02.059
Nope. Your place stinks.

00:10:02.643 --> 00:10:03.519
No, it doesn't!

00:10:03.602 --> 00:10:07.481
Damp shoes, trash in the sink,
and drying clothes inside.

00:10:08.065 --> 00:10:12.445
All the smells have intermingled
and turned into a nasty feud!

00:10:12.528 --> 00:10:15.406
I got something
that'll turn the situation around!

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.909
-Herbs.
-Greens? Where'd you get all this?!

00:10:19.744 --> 00:10:21.162
The store.

00:10:21.245 --> 00:10:25.666
Mix baking soda with herb-infused oil
and it turns into a first-rate good!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.502
You whipped out your specialty!

00:10:28.586 --> 00:10:30.421
Mixing white powder with stuff!

00:10:30.504 --> 00:10:33.174
And if you tie a ribbon
around the container, it'll look cute.

00:10:34.634 --> 00:10:35.634
Next!

00:10:35.718 --> 00:10:36.552
TIGHTEN

00:10:36.635 --> 00:10:41.515
Choose your favorite herbs
and tie 'em together to make a wreath!

00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:42.558
All done!

00:10:43.726 --> 00:10:44.769
Cute, huh?

00:10:44.852 --> 00:10:45.811
Right, yes!

00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:48.898
Yours is really cute too.

00:10:48.981 --> 00:10:51.025
Not as cute as yours, Boss!

00:10:52.443 --> 00:10:55.321
A lavender wreath for the bedroom!

00:10:55.404 --> 00:10:56.655
Oh, it smells nice.

00:10:57.239 --> 00:10:59.450
It eases tension
in the sympathetic nerves

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:01.952
and helps you relax and sleep well.

00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:04.121
Blue Ice in the toilet!

00:11:04.205 --> 00:11:06.957
Wow, how do I put it? It smells nice!

00:11:07.625 --> 00:11:11.671
The scent of cypress makes you feel
as if you're forest bathing!

00:11:11.754 --> 00:11:13.798
Peppermint for the kitchen!

00:11:13.881 --> 00:11:16.384
Oh yeah, this… smells nice!

00:11:16.967 --> 00:11:22.890
The clean scent can revitalize
and help you feel refreshed!

00:11:23.933 --> 00:11:24.809
SCAMPER

00:11:24.892 --> 00:11:27.019
-It's a cockroach.
-What?!

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:31.565
No need for panic. Peppermint
also has insect-repellant properties!

00:11:31.649 --> 00:11:34.068
It'll make even the Black Bullet
cower in fear!

00:11:35.403 --> 00:11:36.570
What are you doing?!

00:11:36.654 --> 00:11:37.822
They crop up a lot.

00:11:38.406 --> 00:11:39.407
Hey.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:40.866
Masa.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.327
Don't move!

00:11:43.953 --> 00:11:44.787
Oh, I missed.

00:11:47.081 --> 00:11:50.960
Well anyway, air circulation is important.

00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:58.467
I've been obsessed
with needle felting lately!

00:11:58.551 --> 00:11:59.719
How adorable!

00:11:59.802 --> 00:12:00.928
Needle felting?

00:12:01.512 --> 00:12:04.640
You poke it like this with a needle
and add in colors and such.

00:12:05.266 --> 00:12:07.935
-It's like getting inked then.
-No.

00:12:08.018 --> 00:12:10.855
GREAM CRAFT SHOP

00:12:12.898 --> 00:12:16.026
"Make your own felt kitty-cat."

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.279
Might be a good gift for Miku.

00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:21.449
Where is it? It's not here!

00:12:22.283 --> 00:12:24.410
There should be a kitty-cat set.

00:12:24.493 --> 00:12:27.872
'Scuse me, Boss Lady.
This what you're looking for?

00:12:27.955 --> 00:12:30.082
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:32.585
Why would I be interested in such an item?

00:12:32.668 --> 00:12:34.795
Only two left.

00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:35.713
SWIPE

00:12:36.464 --> 00:12:40.342
Well, all right then!
I'll take care of this one myself!

00:12:42.678 --> 00:12:43.554
Wait!

00:12:44.138 --> 00:12:46.515
You call yourself a man?

00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:50.603
Finish what you started
and teach me how to make it!

00:12:55.524 --> 00:12:59.403
I'm no stranger to the needle.
Don't underestimate me!

00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:02.072
How's yours going, Boss Lady?

00:13:02.615 --> 00:13:03.449
Uh…

00:13:03.532 --> 00:13:05.075
Boss Lady, allow me--

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:07.661
Keep your mitts off my little one!

00:13:08.412 --> 00:13:11.624
It's still not done!
You think I'd call this finished?!

00:13:11.707 --> 00:13:14.335
Sorry, Boss Lady.
I didn't mean to interfere.

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:17.296
Indeed. But Tatsu…

00:13:18.923 --> 00:13:19.840
Help me.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:22.134
PIN PIN

00:13:22.218 --> 00:13:24.178
Such speed!

00:13:24.261 --> 00:13:26.889
He's using different needles
for different parts!

00:13:26.972 --> 00:13:29.099
His felting speed is on a different level!

00:13:30.184 --> 00:13:32.436
Behold, the Immortal Dragon.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.773
His prey drive is still as sharp as ever!

00:13:37.024 --> 00:13:39.610
Boss Lady, I've avenged you.

00:13:43.405 --> 00:13:44.281
Boss Lady?

00:13:46.492 --> 00:13:47.576
I can't stand it!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.787
Then you do the same for the body.

00:13:54.542 --> 00:13:58.170
It took some time,
but look at this beauty.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:05.052
Now you're my little one, Hanako…

00:14:06.136 --> 00:14:08.347
I managed to make my own as well.

00:14:09.807 --> 00:14:11.225
Huh? That's incredible.

00:14:12.476 --> 00:14:14.395
The Way of the Househusband!

00:14:16.313 --> 00:14:18.190
EPISODE 84

00:14:22.444 --> 00:14:23.279
Come here.

00:14:23.362 --> 00:14:24.363
CHOMP

00:14:24.947 --> 00:14:25.781
Ouch…

00:14:27.074 --> 00:14:29.660
Now, now, it's all right. Don't be scared.

00:14:29.743 --> 00:14:30.744
CHOMP

00:14:31.328 --> 00:14:33.706
You're just scared, aren't you?

00:14:34.331 --> 00:14:36.417
See? Nothing to be scared of.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.334
Ouch!
